WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.760
I'm Jenna Fisher.

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.060
And I'm Angela Kinsey.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.340
We were on The Office together.

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600
And we're best friends.

5
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:12.420
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office Rewatch podcast just for you.

6
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:19.400
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.

7
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.540
We're The Office ladies.

8
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.620
Get out your snorkels.

9
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.780
Uh, I am so excited today.

10
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:34.640
I loved this episode in The Rewatch.

11
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.680
It was so fun.

12
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:41.580
And we have so many fun people who are going to share memories from this episode.

13
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.120
I say let's get into it.

14
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:43.680
I'm excited.

15
00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:48.480
Well, before we get started, we have some morning announcements.

16
00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:51.000
Did you have morning announcements in school?

17
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.360
Like, did a person come on the intercom and give you morning announcements?

18
00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:56.260
Yes.

19
00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:57.240
Me too.

20
00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:57.900
Me too.

21
00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.700
I think they still do it.

22
00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.280
I think there's still morning announcements.

23
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:09.200
We had this thing when I was a senior in high school where the seniors got to take over the morning announcements for a week.

24
00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:10.260
I know.

25
00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:11.500
It was like a big fun thing.

26
00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:12.420
All right.

27
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.780
Well, I'm going to do my best at a morning announcement.

28
00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.160
This is really exciting.

29
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:23.580
We now have signed copies of our book, The Office BFFs, available for pre-order.

30
00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:33.820
They are online right now at the following retailers, Barnes & Noble, Books-A-Million, BJ's Wholesalers, and Premier Collectibles.

31
00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:39.520
And you can support independent bookstores by purchasing a signed copy at Strand Bookstore.

32
00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:53.440
You guys, Jenna and I signed thousands of copies of books, boxes and boxes of these sheets of paper that were pages from our book that they bind into the book.

33
00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:54.320
Yes.

34
00:01:54.780 --> 00:02:00.260
And, I mean, our families, I feel like they were like, what are you, are you signing more?

35
00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:01.360
Okay, are you signing more?

36
00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:01.740
What do you do?

37
00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:02.500
Oh, you're signing more?

38
